    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“They looked for you in all the usual places. None of them were the right shape.”</em></p><p><strong>The Quiet Inside (1/Short Rest; recharges on Soma Break).</strong> As a reaction when you are targeted by a divination, mind-reading, or truth-detection effect, you may force the caster to roll their effect against your Resolve instead of its normal save DC. On a failure, the effect returns nothing — no partial information, no awareness that a target was present. On a success, you take 1 point of Stress from the pressure of the probe.</p>",
